  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Orange Corners: Alumni Accelerator (PCB22MC01)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With the Orange Corners (OC) Alumni Accelerator Programme, some of the most promising and committed OC alumni will be selected and get an opportunity to participate in an online accelerator programme to further their growth and development. The purpose of this project is to strengthen and grow young entrepreneurs that have successfully concluded an Orange Corners (OC) incubation or acceleration programme, specifically in the fields of investor readiness, access to (international) finance and building an international network, most notably including the Netherlands, for better access to international knowledge, partnerships and trade.</narrative>
  </description>
